{"id":"gorgon-of-xathrid","name":"Gorgon of Xathrid","type":"character","aliases":["the gorgon","the woman"],"description":"A cursed gorgon from Xathrid who tortures Sentos for the eyes of a righteous man demanded by a demon, and who takes the ring.","pages":1,"first_seen":"2012-07-03","last_seen":"2012-07-03","description_citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Xathrid Gorgon","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-07-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Xathrid Gorgon\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Jul 2012."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03-e2","era":null,"summary":"A woman holds a blade to Sentos's throat and demands to know whether he is Sentos the Merciful.","participants":["sentos","gorgon-of-xathrid"],"location":"monastery-in-the-borderland-mountains","importance":"major","page":"stories/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","order":358,"story_date":"2012-07-03","storyline":"Magic 2013","source":"wizards","paragraph":11,"quote":"\"Are you Sentos the Merciful?\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03#:~:text=%22Are%20you%20Sentos%20the%20Merciful%3F%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Xathrid Gorgon","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-07-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03#:~:text=%22Are%20you%20Sentos%20the%20Merciful%3F%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Xathrid Gorgon\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03-e3","era":null,"summary":"The woman stabs Sentos in the back and makes him recount what happened on Fleet Rock, and he says the silver-haired man was the false king.","participants":["sentos","gorgon-of-xathrid","false-king"],"location":"monastery-in-the-borderland-mountains","importance":"major","page":"stories/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","order":358,"story_date":"2012-07-03","storyline":"Magic 2013","source":"wizards","paragraph":20,"quote":"\"No one told me he was the false king.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03#:~:text=%22No%20one%20told%20me,was%20the%20false%20king.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Xathrid Gorgon","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-07-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03#:~:text=%22No%20one%20told%20me,was%20the%20false%20king.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Xathrid Gorgon\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03-e5","era":null,"summary":"The woman reveals she is cursed and that a demon demands the eyes of a righteous man.","participants":["gorgon-of-xathrid","the-demon"],"location":"monastery-in-the-borderland-mountains","importance":"major","page":"stories/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","order":358,"story_date":"2012-07-03","storyline":"Magic 2013","source":"wizards","paragraph":31,"quote":"A demon requires payment. He demands the eyes of a righteous man.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03#:~:text=A%20demon%20requires%20payment.,of%20a%20righteous%20man.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Xathrid Gorgon","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-07-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03#:~:text=A%20demon%20requires%20payment.,of%20a%20righteous%20man.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Xathrid Gorgon\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03-e6","era":null,"summary":"She pushes back her hood and reveals herself as a gorgon of Xathrid whose gaze petrifies.","participants":["gorgon-of-xathrid","sentos"],"location":"monastery-in-the-borderland-mountains","importance":"major","page":"stories/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","order":358,"story_date":"2012-07-03","storyline":"Magic 2013","source":"wizards","paragraph":32,"quote":"A gorgon, a monster of Xathrid, with the power to petrify a man with her gaze.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03#:~:text=A%20gorgon%2C%20a%20monster,man%20with%20her%20gaze.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Xathrid Gorgon","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-07-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03#:~:text=A%20gorgon%2C%20a%20monster,man%20with%20her%20gaze.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Xathrid Gorgon\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03-e7","era":null,"summary":"Sentos grabs a shard of the broken flask and stabs the gorgon in the heart, releasing a flood of black snakes.","participants":["sentos","gorgon-of-xathrid"],"location":"monastery-in-the-borderland-mountains","importance":"major","page":"stories/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","order":358,"story_date":"2012-07-03","storyline":"Magic 2013","source":"wizards","paragraph":34,"quote":"Sentos grabbed a shard of glass, whirled around, and plunged into her heart.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03#:~:text=Sentos%20grabbed%20a%20shard,plunged%20into%20her%20heart.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Xathrid Gorgon","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-07-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03#:~:text=Sentos%20grabbed%20a%20shard,plunged%20into%20her%20heart.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Xathrid Gorgon\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03-e8","era":null,"summary":"The snakes bite Sentos and petrify when they meet the gorgon's gaze; she pins him with her foot.","participants":["sentos","gorgon-of-xathrid"],"location":"monastery-in-the-borderland-mountains","importance":"minor","page":"stories/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","order":358,"story_date":"2012-07-03","storyline":"Magic 2013","source":"wizards","paragraph":36,"quote":"The gorgon's foot slammed into the back of his neck, pinning him down in the nest of petrified snakes.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03#:~:text=The%20gorgon%27s%20foot%20slammed,nest%20of%20petrified%20snakes.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Xathrid Gorgon","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-07-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03#:~:text=The%20gorgon%27s%20foot%20slammed,nest%20of%20petrified%20snakes.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Xathrid Gorgon\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Jul 2012."}},{"id":"xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03-e9","era":null,"summary":"The gorgon cuts off Sentos's finger and takes the ring, which grants ceaseless life.","par