gorgon-2012-07-03#:~:text=But%20he%20heard%20the,stone%20of%20his%20face.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Xathrid Gorgon\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Jul 2012."}}],"relations":[],"pages_say":[{"page":"stories/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","order":358,"story_date":"2012-07-03","presence":"appears","source":"wizards","description":"A cursed gorgon from Xathrid who tortures Sentos for the eyes of a righteous man demanded by a demon, and who takes the ring.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Xathrid Gorgon","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2012-07-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/xathrid-gorgon-2012-07-03","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Xathrid Gorgon\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Jul 2012."}}]}
